stdout:
reference[41]: Set expiry to now + D (positive Go duration). Only an unexpired lease with a,verified live owner on this machine can be extended. It cannot be resurrected.,A --protect-live-owner lease with a live owner also renews after expiry when its,resource is still present (status reattached). A protected lease refused for,"reason owner_dead, owner_unknown, resource_absent or resource_unknown exits 3;",every other refusal exits 1. A refusal leaves the lease unchanged.,"With the consumer contract on, every refusal exits 3 with a reason: also","expired, wrong_machine, job_deadline and not_found; exit 1 is then only for","operation failures, and success carries contract: 1 and status renewed.","Examples:","  dibs extend <id> --ttl 2h","  dibs extend <id> --ttl 30m --json","",Touch heartbeat files at most every staleness/3. Extend a lease at the latest,when one third of its TTL remains. Owner death OR expiry makes an unprotected,"lease reclaimable, so its live owner can lose its resources by missing either","cadence. With --protect-live-owner, only proven owner death reclaims; a late",extend with a live owner reattaches when the resource is still present.,"Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Consumer contract 1 is off until DIBS_CONSUMER_CONTRACT=1 or \"consumer_contract\":","true in the user config. While off, reconcile, reclaim, explain, --pending and","--key exit 2 naming the setting, and extend and release behave as described above.","While on, these commands and extend and release follow contract 1:","exit 0 success with status; 1 operation failed, records retained; 2 usage;","3 refusal, nothing changed, with a stable reason: not_found, wrong_machine,","not_pending, already_leased, key_conflict, handle_exists, handle_mismatch,","resource_absent, resource_unknown, ambiguous, owner_alive, owner_unknown,","expired, owner_dead, job_deadline. Extend success is renewed or reattached.","Exit 1 is only for operation failures. Output carries contract: 1.",See docs/consumer-contract.md.,"","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;",75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child,was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait,failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.,76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).,Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure.
usage: "dibs extend <id> --ttl D [--json]"
